{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/adobe/asset-share-commons/pulls/672", "id": 797573212, "node_id": "PR_kwDOBmdems4vigBc", "html_url": "https://github.com/adobe/asset-share-commons/pull/672", "diff_url": "https://github.com/adobe/asset-share-commons/pull/672.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/adobe/asset-share-commons/pull/672.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/adobe/asset-share-commons/issues/672", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/adobe/asset-share-commons/pulls/672/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/adobe/asset-share-commons/pulls/672/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/adobe/asset-share-commons/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/adobe/asset-share-commons/issues/672/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/adobe/asset-share-commons/statuses/51e1f5b2b51a77a116ce898c6914c680391842ad", "number": 672, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "Fix 4 flaky tests by using LinkedHashMap", "user": {"login": "LeoYimingLi", "id": 46290389, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjkwMzg5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46290389?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi", "html_url": "https://github.com/LeoYimingLi", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "<!--- Provide a general summary of your changes in the Title above -->\r\n\r\n## Description\r\n\r\n- Related 4 flaky tests:\r\n  - com.adobe.aem.commons.assetshare.content.renditions.download.impl.AssetRenditionsDownloadServletTest#doPost\r\n  - com.adobe.aem.commons.assetshare.content.renditions.download.impl.AssetRenditionsZipperImplTest#getZipEntryName\r\n  - com.adobe.aem.commons.assetshare.content.renditions.download.impl.AssetRenditionsZipperImplTest#getZipEntryName_GenerateUniqueZipFileNameEntry\r\n  - com.adobe.aem.commons.assetshare.content.renditions.download.impl.AssetRenditionsZipperImplTest#pack\r\n\r\n- The flakiness is due to the nondeterministic iterative order of ```HashMap``` in ```variables.keySet().toArray()```\r\n  https://github.com/adobe/asset-share-commons/blob/ee3ef7051e3ea3eb7f5d904fac177bc56623c6ed/core/src/main/java/com/adobe/aem/commons/assetshare/content/renditions/download/impl/AssetRenditionsZipperImpl.java#L182-L184\r\n\r\n- This proposed method is changing ```HashMap``` to ```LinkedHashMap``` to keep the order deterministic.    \r\n\r\n## Related Issue\r\nhttps://github.com/adobe/asset-share-commons/issues/673\r\n\r\n## Motivation and Context\r\n\r\nThe nondeterministic iterative order of HashMap in ```variables.keySet().toArray()``` can cause the 4 tests to fail. By replacing ```HashMap``` with ```LinkedHashMap```, the flaky tests can be fixed.\r\n\r\n## How Has This Been Tested?\r\n\r\n- Version of ```asset-share-commons```\r\n  SHA: ee3ef7051e3ea3eb7f5d904fac177bc56623c6ed\r\n\r\n- JVM version\r\n  > openjdk version \"1.8.0_292\"\r\nOpenJDK Runtime Environment (build 1.8.0_292-8u292-b10-0ubuntu1~18.04-b10)\r\nOpenJDK 64-Bit Server VM (build 25.292-b10, mixed mode)\r\n\r\n- The way to reproduce the flaky test failure (using the test ```com.adobe.aem.commons.assetshare.content.renditions.download.impl.AssetRenditionsZipperImplTest#pack``` as example)\r\n  - 0.Environment setup: Maven 3.6.0 and Java 1.8.0_292\r\n  - 1.clone the repo:\r\n  ```\r\n  git clone https://github.com/adobe/asset-share-commons\r\n  cd asset-share-commons\r\n  git checkout ee3ef7051e3ea3eb7f5d904fac177bc56623c6ed\r\n  ```\r\n  - 2.run with [Nondex tool](https://github.com/TestingResearchIllinois/NonDex) (which explores different behaviors of under-determined APIs and reports test failures)\r\n  ```\r\n  mvn install -pl core -am -DskipTests\r\n  mvn -pl core edu.illinois:nondex-maven-plugin:1.1.2:nondex -Dtest=com.adobe.aem.commons.assetshare.content.renditions.download.impl.AssetRenditionsZipperImplTest#pack\r\n  ```\r\n  - 3.And we can get the test failure screenshot:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/46290389/145168414-0c71b6bc-55a2-4e11-bd97-1f5c57fe5049.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n  - 4.about the code trace:\r\n  ```\r\n  mvn -pl core edu.illinois:nondex-maven-plugin:1.1.2:debug -Dtest=com.adobe.aem.commons.assetshare.content.renditions.download.impl.AssetRenditionsZipperImplTest#pack\r\n  ```  \r\n    we can get the code trace result\r\n  ![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/46290389/145168434-5b4ef3c4-9a52-4a52-9f9d-406a2e6a0e37.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Screenshots (if appropriate):\r\n\r\n## Types of changes\r\n\r\n<!--- What types of changes does your code introduce? Put an `x` in all the boxes that apply: -->\r\n\r\n- [x] Bug fix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)\r\n- [ ] New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\r\n- [ ] Breaking change (fix or feature that would cause existing functionality to change)\r\n\r\n## Checklist:\r\n\r\n<!--- Go over all the following points, and put an `x` in all the boxes that apply. -->\r\n<!--- If you're unsure about any of these, don't hesitate to ask. We're here to help! -->\r\n\r\n- [x] I have signed the [Adobe Open Source CLA](https://opensource.adobe.com/cla.html).\r\n- [x] My code follows the code style of this project.\r\n- [ ] My change requires a change to the documentation.\r\n- [ ] I have updated the documentation accordingly.\r\n- [x] I have read the **CONTRIBUTING** document.\r\n- [ ] I have added tests to cover my changes.\r\n- [ ] All new and existing tests passed.\r\n", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2021-12-08T07:50:48Z", "updated_at": "2022-01-21T17:19:47Z", "closed_at": "2022-01-21T17:19:47Z", "merged_at": "2022-01-21T17:19:47Z", "merge_commit_sha": "a7b1dece99b3123934a5830b024c9a5d62411841", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "LeoYimingLi:LeoYimingLi-patch-1", "ref": "LeoYimingLi-patch-1", "repo": {"id": 436148443, "node_id": "R_kgDOGf8Y2w", "name": "asset-share-commons", "full_name": "LeoYimingLi/asset-share-commons", "owner": {"login": "LeoYimingLi", "id": 46290389, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjkwMzg5", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46290389?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi", "html_url": "https://github.com/LeoYimingLi", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/LeoYimingLi/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "private": false, "fork": true, "archived": false, "disabled": false, "description": "A modern, open-source asset share reference implementation built on Adobe Experience Manag